			"text": "Comments, the Return Triage Tasks comments and a new work item's description accept **bold**, _italics_, __underline__, `inline code`, fenced multiline code blocks, and [anchor](https://example.com). Raw HTML is shown as text. In the form, See supported comment markdown. opens a callout with these rules; its × hides it again. In the form's comment, a Return Triage Tasks comment or a new work item's description, press Ctrl+V with an image on the clipboard to add it. A marker such as ![image-1.png](pasted:1) appears where you pasted; the image is uploaded to TFS when you save and shown in its place. Delete the marker to drop the image. Images up to 4 MB are accepted. If an upload fails, nothing is saved and the form stays open so you can try again; in Return Triage Tasks only that task stays, for Retry. Copy Comment copies the text only."
