			"text": "CalcEngines now uses a standardized, scrollable list with searchable filenames and checkout owners, sortable Name and environment-version columns, and shared filtering controls. Manage opens the KAT DataStore management website with single sign-on (SSO) using your DataStore credentials. If automatic sign-in is unavailable or unsuccessful, the website opens for normal sign-in. Control stale-checkout notifications under Settings > Releases: set when your checkouts turn red and when teammates' checkouts appear, or hide teammates' checkout notifications. Open task references, including completed tasks, from CalcEngine History in Work Item Detail inside KCC. Closing the details returns to the same CalcEngine History and scroll position without leaving the app. CalcEngines and Version History switch to compact card layouts in narrow windows, keeping versions, checkouts, and actions readable. A temporary DataStore startup sign-in failure can be retried on refresh using remembered credentials, rather than asking you to re-enter credentials already saved. Show marks upper-file checkouts that can block the TFS Release Pipeline in amber and newer upper versions that block QA in red. Blocked version tooltips explain the mismatch. Checkouts do not prevent manual approval or promotion. Promotion warns before force-checking in an upper file held by someone other than you or the authority, and stops if that check-in fails. Check Mine In now checks in only your files in the filtered rows, rather than all your checkouts. Downloads use the original filename; DEV and UAT downloads no longer add _Test. Changes to CalcEngine Patterns last for the current site selection; selecting a site again or restarting restores its catalog patterns."
